            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The officers arrived at the petitioner's home and already knew him."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court Transcript",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad9797ec722593b68c1ac8140c40d9cdec4bff17e406a7bb3a7151b6990aece9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad9797ec7225-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The officers interrupted the petitioner, escorted him downstairs after he asked for shoes, and then took him to the jailhouse."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad9797ec722593b68c1ac8140c40d9cdec4bff17e406a7bb3a7151b6990aece9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad9797ec7225-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "At the jailhouse the petitioner received full Miranda warnings, understood them, and voluntarily waived his right to counsel."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad9797ec722593b68c1ac8140c40d9cdec4bff17e406a7bb3a7151b6990aece9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad9797ec7225-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The court noted that any evidence derived from the petitioner's statements must be suppressed unless the government can prove sufficient attenuation of the taint."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner (Waxman)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad9797ec722593b68c1ac8140c40d9cdec4bff17e406a7bb3a7151b6990aece9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad9797ec7225-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The court also stated that the fruits of the statement must be suppressed under the Nix and Wade precedents."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad9797ec722593b68c1ac8140c40d9cdec4bff17e406a7bb3a7151b6990aece9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad9797ec7225-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether police officers generally know that once an indictment is filed, the Sixth Amendment applies as well as the Fifth."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ad9797ec722593b68c1ac8140c40d9cdec4bff17e406a7bb3a7151b6990aece9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ad9797ec7225-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether the issue of deliberate elicitation is a legal conclusion."
      }
    ],
